# Testing

Use `FrozenClock` for schedule and worker tests. Do not assert against the machine clock.

Stub DeepSeek and Threads. Integration tests that need row locks use the Testcontainers Postgres fixture and truncate between tests.

Cover status transitions, manual approval, publish retry without a new generation, concurrent claim, stuck recovery, rate limit, expired authorization, provider errors, and an ambiguous publish timeout.

A response test must fail if a secret or ciphertext appears in JSON. Demo end-to-end flow must show that nothing was sent to Threads.

Frontend unit tests use Vitest and Testing Library. Playwright covers the demo UI against a running stack and is not part of `npm test`.
